      <div id="sutta">
            <h4 id="thag1.68" class="h1">Thag 1:68  Ekudāniya</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>Of heightened awareness &amp; heedful,</p>
              <p>the sage trained in sagacity’s ways:</p>
              <p>He has no sorrows, one who is Such,</p>
              <p>calmed &amp; ever mindful.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
